{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act27side_level_act27side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act27side",
  "stageId": "act27side_02",
  "title": "小藍孩",
  "storyCode": "SL-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act27side/level_act27side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "839e66ac5c60cb04a4c569464ade5a4d53dfeab8e658691490fd837b110b0f53",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天去哪裡玩呢？我們已經被禁止在溫泉店裡游泳了......多叫幾個人去箱子地塊捉迷藏怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "埃尼斯說了不讓我們去海邊。我還想再去火山博物館看看，上次還沒找到爸爸呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別找了，找不到的......對了，埃尼斯今天在哪裡打工？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天是星期三，下午三點，應該在幫湯姆爺爺看店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩&小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "冰淇淋店！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要巧克力味的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要草莓味的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等一下，湯姆爺爺今天是不是做了新口味？蛋糕味的冰淇淋是什麼味道？可以多給我們一個嚐嚐嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "湯姆爺爺說過，每個小孩子每天只有一個球的份額。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你從來不吃冰淇淋的，可以把你的那一份讓給我們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要這樣，埃尼斯也很辛苦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不不，我可不算小孩子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是今天天氣很熱，冰淇淋化得要更快一點，吃到嘴裡就不滿一個了，這不公平。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，怎麼辦呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天天氣很熱，蛋糕味的冰淇淋看起來也很好吃對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩&小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（眼巴巴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......如果你們保證在晚飯前回家並且幫哈莉擺好餐具的話，我就瞞著湯姆爺爺多給你們一個怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩&小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "每次都這麼說，希望你們吃晚飯的時候能藏好一點啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一個甜筒冰淇淋慢悠悠地在小女孩的眼前飄過。小女孩愣了神，湯匙裡好大一塊冰淇淋，在烈日下融化了。\n草莓味的冰淇淋滴落在地面上，留下一攤水跡。不見身形的生物踩了上去，顯現了它的腳印。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛才好像有一隻冰淇淋跑走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "冰淇淋跑了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好像也是草莓味的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果抓到它的話是不是可以多吃一個球了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也可以要一份冰淇淋嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三金券。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦，我不能免費領嗎？真可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別開玩笑了女士，這裡還是要做生意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那請給我咖啡味的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝惠顧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個時候還有外國遊客來汐斯塔，真稀奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可能是你低估了這裡的魅力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你為什麼沒有在享受這個夏日呢？在我的家鄉，像你這個年紀的孩子都應該在大街小巷瘋跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當一個受歡迎的好哥哥不容易吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "生活所迫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你會什麼樂器嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "樂器？我連歌唱課都沒有上過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拇指琴......算嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......我覺得你的氣質，會很適合薩克斯風。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，聽起來不像是我的經濟能力承擔得起的樂器啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我今天心情不錯，因為找到了一份新工作。如果我請你一杯的話，可以再多和我聊聊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，時間到了，我要去做下一份工作了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是下次還想一起聊天的話，就來我家的店吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香氛店店主",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的意思是說，物流中心可以幫我把商品賣到國外去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不僅如此，以後您想要購買什麼物品都會更方便一點。比如說，您要製作香氛，可以直接從原產地買到最新鮮的原料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香氛店店主",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......聽起來還挺不錯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以您願意接受搬遷嗎？還有之後的民意調查裡，能不能請您投票支持峯馳物流呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香氛店店主",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真、真的嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香氛店店主",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反正我本來就打算搬去市中心住了，但以後要是能更容易買到維多利亞的時裝，聽起來還是蠻有吸引力的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多謝您的支持！我就先不打擾您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香氛店店主",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎哎，別著急走嘛。要不要瞭解一下這裡的香氛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香氛店店主",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我來給你推薦幾款，一定適合你這樣可愛的男孩子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好、好的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿，小子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大帝先生？！您也是來度假的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "度假是一種心態，我每一天都在度假。但是誰會在這樣一個夏天待在平時待的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，這是次要的。我來這裡是要拿回我自己的東西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那幾個不知好歹的羊崽子偷了我珍藏的專輯！是我第一次在黑曜石音樂節演出奪得當年金獎的專輯！編號000001的專輯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我承認多利是為數不多能和我在音樂上聊得來的存在，但我一定要嚴厲指責他把自己的分身扔得滿世界都是的行為！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "難道他認為那些羊崽子和我的音樂一樣能帶給人靈魂的昇華嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您說什麼，多利是誰......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，算了，不重要。這是一種你們無法理解的更高級的衝突——說回你吧，你在這裡做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你身上是什麼味道？聞起來像是在薩爾貢雨林的泥漿涮了三圈後又摔倒在了雞尾酒派對的香檳塔裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有這麼糟糕嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "峯馳物流想要承包這一片商業街的改建專案，但是現在遇到了一些競爭對手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，這就是你們的搶地盤遊戲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "歐厄爾呢？該不會是那個老頭把工作都甩給你後自己去度假了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也不能這樣講......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都可以，祝你好運，小子。最好能趁他不注意把他手裡的股份都搶過來，給他一點夏日驚喜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣，說不定下次派對我就能和他也有點共同話題聊聊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，聊天停止！我剛剛好像看到了——嘿！兩個眼睛沒聚焦的羊崽子，還我專輯！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羊......什麼？"
    },
    {
