      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "逛街啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跟著旅遊手冊上推薦的遊玩路線在這裡轉了一整圈，結果發現那些推薦的店鋪和龍門的也沒什麼兩樣，正準備回去。"
