    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "車子引擎太舊了，容易點不著火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我幫你看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有人用紙團把車的散熱口堵住了，是誰這麼無聊......這張紙是，傳單？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......大概是誰家的調皮小孩搞的惡作劇吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那沒什麼事的話，我先去忙了，謝謝你！"
